<title>SINGAPORE: Compaq opens service centre in Singapore.</title>
<headline>Compaq opens service centre in Singapore.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compaq Computer Asia said on Thursday it had launched a service centre in Singapore, its second in Asia.</p>
<p>The centre provides Compaq users with general servicing, repairs and upgrading of its products.</p>
<p>It also houses a workshop, demonstration and discussion room.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
